    {
      "id": "claim_07160c512ae145349b1942af3c1d5f9c",
      "statement": "FeedFetcher bounds the fetched body to DEFAULT_MAX_FEED_BYTES (10 MiB) by reading at most maxFeedBytes+1 bytes and throwing FeedFetchException (mapped to HTTP 422) if the body exceeds that cap, preventing an oversized or streaming response from exhausting heap.",
