      "id": "claim_a476cd127e094968b61561ecd7d86f8a",
      "statement": "FeedParser resolves XML feed charset in a fixed priority order: an explicit charset in the Content-Type header wins; otherwise ROME's XmlReader raw-mode detection via BOM then the XML prolog's encoding= attribute is used; otherwise UTF-8. JSON Feed documents rely on Jackson's own UTF-family auto-detection instead of this path.",
