      "statement": "The frontend sanitizes reader-view extracted HTML with DOMPurify.sanitize using FORBID_TAGS/FORBID_ATTR of ['style'], which additionally strips style tags/attributes beyond the default DOMPurify sanitization applied to normal feed-supplied article content, so publisher page styling (e.g. dark backgrounds) cannot override the app's theme.",
